> +	for (i = 0; i < ris->props.num_mbwu_mon; i++) {
> +		mbwu_state = &ris->mbwu_state[i];
> +		cfg = &mbwu_state->cfg;

Could pull some of the local variable declarations in here to make
their scope clear.

